                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">The Job<br /></span></p>\n<p><strong>Der Brogen</strong></p>\n<p>Located in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.</p>\n<p>At R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.</p>\n<p>Located in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Venetia</strong></p>\n<p>Located in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.</p>\n<p>At R11.6 billion, the Redstone project is the largest renewable energy investment in South Africa.</p>\n<p>Located in the Humansrus Solar Park in the Northern Cape Province, the Redstone project is in close proximity to the 96MW Jasper and the 75MW Lesedi photovoltaic (PV) solar power projects developed by SolarReserve.</p>\n<p> </p>",
